    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "What began as an equipment failure quickly spiraled into a full-blown grid incident when the pompous official at the grid operator panicked, placing the Visayas under red alert. This sudden energy demand spike, driven by the predictable heatwave officials ignored, left a significant power shortage. The self-serious bureaucrats then botched the grid with desperate cuts, a foolish attempt to stabilize the system.",
